---
import PublicLayout from "@/layouts/PublicLayout.astro";
---

<PublicLayout title="关于">
  <section class="container max-w-2xl py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="space-y-14 md:space-y-16 animate-stagger-container">
      <header class="space-y-6 animate-item">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
          About · 关于我
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
          把感兴趣的事，慢慢做出来
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground">
          我是杨振（spsz0831），一名独立开发者、AI 玩家和自媒体作者。最近在探索 AI 短视频创作，开发宝宝成长记录网站，也在做一款八字命理方向的 App。这里会记录尝试、进展和过程中的思考。
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="animate-item" style="--delay: 1;">
        <div class="mb-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-wide">最近在做</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">持续更新</span>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
          <article class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-3 py-5 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-4">
            <span class="pt-1 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">01</span>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3 class="font-medium tracking-tight">AI 短视频创作</h3>
              <p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">探索 AI 参与短视频创作的方式，边做边记录实践过程。</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-3 py-5 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-4">
            <span class="pt-1 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">02</span>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3 class="font-medium tracking-tight">宝宝成长记录网站</h3>
              <p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">记录宝宝成长中的点滴与变化，网站已完成开发并上线。</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-3 py-5 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-4">
            <span class="pt-1 font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">03</span>
            <div class="space-y-1.5">
              <h3 class="font-medium tracking-tight">八字命理 App</h3>
              <p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">正在开发一款八字命理方向的应用，持续打磨产品想法与实现。</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="animate-item" style="--delay: 2;">
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-base font-semibold tracking-wide">常用工具</h2>
        <dl class="divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">AI 编程</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Claude Code、Codex、Pi agent、ZCode</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">AI 图像</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">即梦、Lovart、Midjourney、CanvaAI</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">AI 视频</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">LibTV、即梦AI、heygen、芒果灵创</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">AI 办公</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Cherry Studio、Workbuddy、Kimi PPT 助手、百度搭子</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">AI 搜索</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">秘塔AI搜索、Perplexity、夸克AI、纳米AI</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="font-medium">内容创作</dt>
            <dd class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">自媒体运营、短视频运营与剪辑、AI 短视频创作</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="animate-item" style="--delay: 3;">
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-base font-semibold tracking-wide">证书与资质</h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
          <li class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-base">C1 驾驶证</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-base">深圳证券交易所 ETF 策略师</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-base">AIGC 应用工程师（高级）</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-base">全国广播电视编辑记者资格证</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 animate-item" style="--delay: 4;">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-wide">工作之外</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
          也喜欢电影和自驾，偶尔把路上的见闻与生活片段写下来。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-8 animate-item" style="--delay: 5;">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-wide">保持联系</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
          坐标上海，欢迎交流。内容合作或项目交流，可以通过下面的方式联系我。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
          <a href="https://github.com/spsz831" target="_blank" aria-label="GitHub" title="GitHub" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <img src="https://image-bed-worker.yangzhen0806.workers.dev/api/file/mio460ow-53of5g5q3p" alt="GitHub" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://yangzhenai.top/images/1764923526016-杨振个人微信.jpg" target="_blank" aria-label="微信二维码" title="微信二维码" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <img src="https://image-bed-worker.yangzhen0806.workers.dev/api/file/mio42yct-3h2p2x5n5j6k" alt="WeChat" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://yangzhenai.top/images/1764684680875-四知先生公众号二维码.jpg" target="_blank" aria-label="公众号二维码" title="公众号二维码" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <img src="https://image-bed-worker.yangzhen0806.workers.dev/api/file/mio41xub-z7158441a5a" alt="Official Account" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://x.com/spsz0831" target="_blank" aria-label="X" title="X" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <img src="https://image-bed-worker.yangzhen0806.workers.dev/api/file/mio41nl8-6a75e4s4qn" alt="Twitter" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:yangzhen0806@gmail.com" aria-label="邮件" title="邮件" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-input bg-background transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <img src="https://image-bed-worker.yangzhen0806.workers.dev/api/file/mio427ef-2pw4s4v303p" alt="Email" width="20" height="20" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </a>
          <a href="/reward" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-yellow-400 text-black hover:bg-yellow-500 h-10 px-4 py-2">
            ☕ Buy me a coffee
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</PublicLayout>

<style>
  /* Staggered Animation */
  .animate-item {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--delay, 0) * 0.1s);
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
